"Context: Validate subject minimum score\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Each grade may only have one minimum score per subject.\n"
"Solution: Remove or merge the minimum score lines of the same grade\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_school_academic
#: code:addons/ssi_school_academic/models/school_subject_minimum_score.py:0
#, python-format
